<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 110,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 110,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est receipts 110,000, Wk ago 116,000, and Yr ago 107,000 head at interior Iowa-Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were steady with mid-session Wednesday. Demand and offerings moderate. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
